==Description==
'''Shocked''' is a sticker that can be purchased in the store for {{Coins|200}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases a shocked Default Level 2 [[Commander]] without its shades. It has a white speech bubble with a red outline next to it, with two exclamation points. It plays a healing sound when used as a placeholder.

==Trivia==
*The [[Commander]]'s expression and speech bubble appear to be a reference to a thumbnail made for the [[v1.33.0]] update, which had the [[Grave Digger]] and its shocked expression become a meme in the Tower Defense Simulator community.
*The sound that plays when using the '''Shocked''' sticker originates from ''Undertale''.
**The same sound also plays when the [[32]] sticker is used.
*'''Shocked''' was given out as a physical sticker by the developers during the Roblox Developer Conference 2025.

